{
  "_comment": [
    "Controlled category vocabulary for the coral reef timeline.",
    "The original event_category is never overwritten; these are added alongside it,",
    "so any mapping decision here can be revisited from the source values.",
    "",
    "Colours are slots 1-7 of the documented dark-mode categorical palette, IN THAT",
    "ORDER. The order is the colourblind-safety mechanism and must not be rearranged;",
    "only which category sits in which slot is an editorial choice.",
    "Validated against the card surface #051628: worst adjacent CVD dE 8.4,",
    "worst adjacent normal-vision dE 19.3, all seven above 3:1 contrast.",
    "At seven categories no palette clears the all-pairs test, so the category NAME",
    "is printed on every card and in the legend. Colour is a scanning aid; the label",
    "is what actually identifies the category."
  ],
  "families": {
    "Reef change": "What happened to reefs",
    "Knowledge": "How we came to know it",
    "People & policy": "How people used and governed reefs"
  },
  "categories": [
    { "slot": 1, "name": "Science & discovery",             "family": "Knowledge",
      "colour": "#3987e5",
      "from": ["Scientific finding", "Scientific debate"] },

    { "slot": 2, "name": "Bleaching & heat stress",         "family": "Reef change",
      "colour": "#d95926",
      "from": ["Bleaching event", "Global bleaching event"] },

    { "slot": 3, "name": "Recovery & resilience",           "family": "Reef change",
      "colour": "#199e70",
      "from": ["Reef recovery"] },

    { "slot": 4, "name": "Experiment, method & monitoring", "family": "Knowledge",
      "colour": "#c98500",
      "from": ["Important experiment", "Technology / methods", "Monitoring milestone",
               "Scientific programme", "Scientific archive"] },

    { "slot": 5, "name": "Crisis & decline",                "family": "Reef change",
      "colour": "#d55181",
